This directory contains files that are relevant for development,
as well as additional tests and verifications.
While bsdiff4 itself supports Python 3.7+, some of these programs
may require higher Python versions.


generate_cases.py
minimize_cases.py
select_cases.py
    Pipeline for generating, minimizing, and selecting inputs that exercise
    the second control-tuple merge rule.


branch2.txt
    The file was obtained with the second merge rule disabled by running:
    $ python select_cases.py >branch2.txt


addition.py
    Demonstration of BSDIFF’s handling of diff addition.


patch.py
    Pure Python implementation of the BSDIFF4 patch-application loop.


shuffle.py
    Demonstration of BSDIFF’s handling of moved data.


test_cli.sh
    Integration tests for the command-line tools and BSDIFF4 compatibility.


test_suffix_array.py
    Additional tests and verifications for suffix_array() which are neither
    part of the regular test suite nor part of any bsdiff4 distributions.
